  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.9.0 - Forms and multi-step flows. Form gains section headings, field hints, errors drawn under each field (ValidateAll, ShowFieldErrors, ValidationMode), Submit and Cancel with keys and an optional Save/Cancel button row, labels beside fields, arrow keys between fields, and snapshot dirty tracking that notices a revert (IValueSnapshot on TextField, TextEditor, Checkbox, RadioGroup, Dropdown, ComboBox, and CheckList). The new Wizard widget runs a multi-step flow with a step header and list, per-step validation, optional and conditional steps, Back, Skip, Next, Finish, and Cancel, and Alt+arrow (and macOS Option+arrow) step keys; WizardModal hosts it in a dialog whose completion is a WizardOutcome. Additive; new behavior is opt-in. Full release history: https://github.com/jchristn/TUIKit/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
